"P1401109544" "-DEF (All), Chance for DoT (Energy)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1564926994" "Your defenses have been reduced. There is a chance you may also be suffering energy damage over time."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1278593998" "{PlayerSource} sears you with their {PowerName}, causing {Damage} points of energy damage and reducing your defenses."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1900200004" "{PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} deals {Damage} points of additional energy damage due to its lingering effect."

