"P3720151530" "Family Healing"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1879360884" "PBAoE, Heal (Self and Allies), HoT (Self and Allies), +RES(Slow, Regen Debuff)"
// Power Help Text :
"P637007078" "You mend the wounds of yourself and nearby allies by placing your bodies in a past or future state where they are far less injured.  Temporal Mending will immediately heal its targets and continue to heal them for an equal amount over the next 6 seconds.  Additionally, affected allies will gain some resistance to slow effects and regeneration debuffs.  Allies affected by the Accelerated effect will receive additional healing from this power.  Temporal Mending will apply a regeneration bonus instead of heal over time for a short while if the user is in a PvP zone.  Recharge: Long"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2008805399" "{PlayerSource} heals you for {Damage} health with {PowerName}."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4030956178" "{PlayerSource} continually heals you for {Damage} health with {PowerName}."
